WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:04,980
This is a temporary shelter

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:11,990
Why don't you give us a room?

3
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:14,390
The staff brought it here was amazing

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:16,630
If we come here on our own, we won't be given a room.

5
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:18,430
It just doesn’t make sense

6
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:20,030
You must arrange a room for me

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:22,350
Sir, we have no room.

8
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:25,030
It just so happens that the last batch of rooms have been occupied.

9
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,390
You see, just wait a little longer

10
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:27,830
If there are vacancies elsewhere

11
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,750
We will arrange your visit as soon as possible

12
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,590
Could you please accept the deployment?

13
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,150
There are also public restrooms inside

14
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:35,350
It’s okay to simply be happy

15
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:37,550
Can you help me arrange a room?

16
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:39,990
Can you please stop making trouble?

17
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:41,870
Is it honorable to embarrass the staff?

18
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:43,150
They have worked very hard

19
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,470
Let you pay attention to the money I don’t want in the future

20
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:55,450
What are you arguing about here? Don't bully seniors.

21
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,130
Isn’t that Xiao Su’s crush?

22
00:00:57,130 --> 00:01:00,250
This world is so small, you can still meet this

23
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:05,030
Where is it? Where is it? I drink

24
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,910
There's a little puppy that's going to cry
